  "term": "hypoactive sexual desire disorder",
  "definition": "Hypoactive sexual desire disorder is a condition involving an ongoing or repeated lack of desire for sexual activity. The reduced desire is not better explained by another psychiatric condition, substance effects, or a general medical condition.",
